 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2013-06-19",
   "text": "Death Tax Repeal Act of 2013 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code to: (1) repeal the estate and generation-skipping transfer taxes, and (2) make permanent the maximum 35% gift tax rate and a $5 million lifetime gift tax exemption. Provides for an inflation adjustment to such exemption amount."
  }
